msgid "Someone"
msgstr "Alguien"

msgid "You're invited to teach"
msgstr "Le invitan a impartir clases"

#. Translators: %(name)s is the invitee's first name; "Hi there," is the
#. greeting without one.
msgid "Hi %(name)s,"
msgstr "Hola, %(name)s:"

#. Translators: the greeting when the email's sender doesn't know the person's
#. name.
msgid "Hi there,"
msgstr "Hola:"

#. Translators: %(inviter)s is the name of the person who sent the invitation.
msgid ""
"%(inviter)s added you as an instructor. You'll see the sessions you teach, "
"your learners and their progress."
msgstr ""
"%(inviter)s le ha añadido como instructor. Verá las sesiones que imparte, "
"sus estudiantes y su progreso."

msgid "Set up your account"
msgstr "Configure su cuenta"

msgid "This invitation expires on %(day)s."
msgstr "Esta invitación caduca el %(day)s."

msgid "You got this email because %(inviter)s invited %(email)s to teach."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque %(inviter)s invitó a %(email)s a "
"impartir clases."

msgid "%(count)s seat"
msgid_plural "%(count)s seats"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s plaza"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s plazas"

#. Translators: two seat lists ("20 seats in Fire safety", "5 seats in First
#. aid"); %(first)s may itself be
#. two or more lists joined by this same sentence.
msgid "%(first)s and %(second)s"
msgstr "%(first)s y %(second)s"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("20 seats"); %(where)s is what
#. they are for.
msgid "%(seats)s in %(where)s"
msgstr "%(seats)s en %(where)s"

#. Translators: what was bought when the order names no batch, in "Your order
#. for seats is confirmed".
msgid "seats"
msgstr "plazas"

msgid "%(tenant)s's manager"
msgstr "Responsable de %(tenant)s"

msgid "You're invited to manage %(tenant)s"
msgstr "Le invitan a gestionar %(tenant)s"

msgid "You've been invited to manage %(tenant)s."
msgstr "Se le ha invitado a gestionar %(tenant)s."

msgid "Sign in with this email address and open the link below to accept:"
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión con esta dirección de correo electrónico y abra el enlace "
"siguiente para aceptar:"

#. Translators: %(days)s is a number of days.
msgid ""
"The link works for %(days)s days. If you ask for a new one, this one stops "
"working."
msgstr ""
"El enlace funciona durante %(days)s días. Si solicita uno nuevo, este dejará"
" de funcionar."

#. Translators: %(inviter)s is a person's name; %(role)s is the role's name in
#. bold.
msgid "%(inviter)s invited you as %(role)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s le ha invitado como %(role)s."

msgid "Hi,"
msgstr "Hola:"

msgid "%(inviter)s invited you to join %(organisation)s as %(role)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s le ha invitado a unirse a %(organisation)s como %(role)s."

msgid "Accept the invitation:"
msgstr "Acepte la invitación:"

msgid "You're invited to join %(organisation)s"
msgstr "Le invitan a unirse a %(organisation)s"

msgid "Accept the invitation"
msgstr "Aceptar la invitación"

msgid "%(inviter)s gave you the %(role)s role at %(organisation)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s le ha asignado el rol %(role)s en %(organisation)s."

msgid "Sign in:"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión:"

msgid "Your role at %(organisation)s"
msgstr "Su rol en %(organisation)s"

#. Translators: %(address)s is the platform's web address.
msgid ""
"Hi %(name)s, your platform is live at %(address)s with your logo, colours "
"and emails set up."
msgstr ""
"Hola, %(name)s: su plataforma ya está disponible en %(address)s con su "
"logotipo, sus colores y sus correos electrónicos configurados."

msgid ""
"Hi, your platform is live at %(address)s with your logo, colours and emails "
"set up."
msgstr ""
"Hola: su plataforma ya está disponible en %(address)s con su logotipo, sus "
"colores y sus correos electrónicos configurados."

msgid ""
"Hi %(name)s, your platform is live with your logo, colours and emails set "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Hola, %(name)s: su plataforma ya está disponible con su logotipo, sus "
"colores y sus correos electrónicos configurados."

msgid "Hi, your platform is live with your logo, colours and emails set up."
msgstr ""
"Hola: su plataforma ya está disponible con su logotipo, sus colores y sus "
"correos electrónicos configurados."

msgid "%(organisation)s is ready"
msgstr "%(organisation)s está lista"

msgid ""
"When you sign in, a setup guide walks you through your first course, batch "
"and team. It takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Al iniciar sesión, una guía de configuración le acompañará en su primer "
"curso, su primera edición y su equipo. Se tarda unos 30 minutos."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión"

msgid "This link works once and expires on %(day)s."
msgstr "Este enlace solo se puede usar una vez y caduca el %(day)s."

#. Translators: %(specialist)s is a person's name and email address, or "the
#. Blend-ed team".
msgid "Your onboarding specialist is %(specialist)s."
msgstr "Su especialista de incorporación es %(specialist)s."

msgid "You got this email because %(organisation)s was set up for %(email)s."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque %(organisation)s se configuró para "
"%(email)s."

msgid "the Blend-ed team"
msgstr "el equipo de Blend-ed"

msgid "You're invited to learn with %(name)s"
msgstr "Le invitan a aprender con %(name)s"

msgid "%(name)s has invited you to learn with them."
msgstr "%(name)s le ha invitado a aprender con él o ella."

#. Translators: %(days)s is a number of days.
msgid ""
"The link works for %(days)s days. If a new one is sent, this one stops "
"working."
msgstr ""
"El enlace funciona durante %(days)s días. Si se envía uno nuevo, este dejará"
" de funcionar."

#. Translators: {date} is the day the link stops working ("19 November 2026
#. UTC": the address has no account to
#. take a time zone from).
msgid ""
"The link works until {date}. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"El enlace funciona hasta el {date}. Si no lo ha solicitado, ignore este "
"correo electrónico."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the name of the AI workspace being opened.
msgid "Confirm your {workspace} workspace"
msgstr "Confirme su espacio de trabajo {workspace}"

#. Translators: {workspace} is the name of the AI workspace being opened.
msgid ""
"Someone asked to open the AI workspace \"{workspace}\" with this email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Alguien ha solicitado abrir el espacio de trabajo de AI «{workspace}» con "
"esta dirección de correo electrónico."

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then open the link "
"below to confirm it:"
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión, o cree una cuenta, con esta dirección de correo electrónico "
"y, después, abra el enlace siguiente para confirmarlo:"

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then confirm the "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión, o cree una cuenta, con esta dirección de correo electrónico "
"y, después, confirme el espacio de trabajo."

msgid "Confirm your workspace"
msgstr "Confirme su espacio de trabajo"

#. Translators: {email} is the address the workspace was requested for.
msgid "You got this email because a workspace was requested for {email}."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque se solicitó un espacio de trabajo para"
" {email}."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the AI workspace's name; {email} the address to
#. sign in with.
msgid ""
"Your AI workspace {workspace} is set up and you manage it. Sign in with "
"{email} to start building courses with AI."
msgstr ""
"Su espacio de trabajo de AI {workspace} está configurado y usted lo "
"gestiona. Inicie sesión con {email} para empezar a crear cursos con AI."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the AI workspace's name.
msgid "Your {workspace} workspace is ready"
msgstr "Su espacio de trabajo {workspace} está listo"

msgid "Pick up where you left off"
msgstr "Continúe donde lo dejó"

msgid ""
"You haven't opened your courses for a while. A few minutes today keeps you "
"on track, and your progress is waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que no abre sus cursos. Unos minutos hoy le ayudarán a mantener "
"el ritmo, y su progreso le está esperando."

#. Translators: {who} is the person asking, {library} the library's title and
#. {note} their own message.
msgid "{who} asks to edit the library {library}. “{note}”"
msgstr "{who} solicita editar la biblioteca {library}. «{note}»"

msgid "{who} asks to edit the library {library}."
msgstr "{who} solicita editar la biblioteca {library}."

#. Translators: {library} is the library's title.
msgid "Access request for {library}"
msgstr "Solicitud de acceso a {library}"

msgid "{count} open response to grade"
msgid_plural "{count} open responses to grade"
msgstr[0] "{count} respuesta abierta por calificar"
msgstr[1] "{count} respuestas abiertas por calificar"

msgid "{count} offline result not entered"
msgid_plural "{count} offline results not entered"
msgstr[0] "{count} resultado presencial sin introducir"
msgstr[1] "{count} resultados presenciales sin introducir"

#. Translators: {id} is the learner's account number, shown when they have no
#. name.
msgid "Learner {id}"
msgstr "Estudiante {id}"

#. Translators: {names} is a comma-separated list of learner names.
msgid "{count} learner below the passing grade: {names}"
msgid_plural "{count} learners below the passing grade: {names}"
msgstr[0] "{count} estudiante por debajo de la nota de aprobado: {names}"
msgstr[1] "{count} estudiantes por debajo de la nota de aprobado: {names}"

#. Translators: {line} is the list of learners above; {more} how many more are
#. not named.
msgid "{line} and {more} more"
msgstr "{line} y {more} más"

#. Translators: {day} is a day and month ("19 November"), "19 November UTC"
#. for a
#. person who chose no time zone.
msgid "Your action items for {day}"
msgstr "Sus tareas para el {day}"

msgid "Certificate expired"
msgstr "Certificado caducado"

msgid "Your certificate has expired. Take the course again to renew it."
msgstr ""
"Su certificado ha caducado. Vuelva a realizar el curso para renovarlo."

msgid "Renew"
msgstr "Renovar"

msgid "a deadline"
msgstr "una fecha límite"

msgid "Due dates moved in {batch}"
msgstr "Fechas de vencimiento movidas en {batch}"

msgid "Extensions removed in {batch}"
msgstr "Ampliaciones retiradas en {batch}"

msgid ""
"{actor} moved the due date for {assessment} for {count} learners to {new}."
msgstr ""
"{actor} movió la fecha de vencimiento de {assessment} para {count} "
"estudiantes al {new}."

msgid ""
"{actor} removed the extended due date for {assessment} for {count} learners."
msgstr ""
"{actor} retiró la fecha de vencimiento ampliada de {assessment} para {count}"
" estudiantes."

msgid "Extension removed in {batch}"
msgstr "Ampliación retirada en {batch}"

#. Translators: {old} and {new} are dates such as "12 Mar"; {reason} is the
#. staff member's words.
msgid ""
"{actor} removed {learner}'s extended due date for {assessment}: it is back "
"to {new} (it was {old}). Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} retiró la fecha de vencimiento ampliada de {learner} para "
"{assessment}: vuelve a ser el {new} (era el {old}). Motivo: {reason}"

msgid ""
"{actor} removed {learner}'s extended due date for {assessment} (it was "
"{old}). Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} retiró la fecha de vencimiento ampliada de {learner} para "
"{assessment} (era el {old}). Motivo: {reason}"

msgid "Due date moved in {batch}"
msgstr "Fecha de vencimiento movida en {batch}"

msgid ""
"{actor} moved {learner}'s due date for {assessment} from {old} to {new}. "
"Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} movió la fecha de vencimiento de {learner} para {assessment} del "
"{old} al {new}. Motivo: {reason}"

msgid ""
"{actor} gave {learner} a new due date for {assessment}: {new}. Reason: "
"{reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} asignó a {learner} una nueva fecha de vencimiento para {assessment}:"
" {new}. Motivo: {reason}"

msgid "Due dates changed in {batch}"
msgstr "Fechas de vencimiento cambiadas en {batch}"

msgid "Due dates changed in {count} of your Batches"
msgstr "Fechas de vencimiento cambiadas en {count} de sus ediciones"

msgid "{actor} changed the due dates of {course}."
msgstr "{actor} cambió las fechas de vencimiento de {course}."

msgid "{name}, you earned a Program certificate!"
msgstr "{name}, ¡ha obtenido un certificado de programa!"

msgid "About this certificate"
msgstr "Acerca de este certificado"

msgid "Certificate ID"
msgstr "ID del certificado"

msgid "Date of issue"
msgstr "Fecha de emisión"

msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "Factura"

msgid "Order"
msgstr "Pedido"

msgid "Purchase order"
msgstr "Orden de compra"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

msgid "Paid in full"
msgstr "Pagado en su totalidad"

msgid "Amount due"
msgstr "Importe pendiente"

msgid "Due by"
msgstr "Fecha de vencimiento"

msgid ""
"Here is invoice %(invoice)s against purchase order %(po)s for order "
"%(order)s from %(seller)s. The PDF is attached."
msgstr ""
"Adjuntamos la factura %(invoice)s correspondiente a la orden de compra "
"%(po)s del pedido %(order)s de %(seller)s en PDF."

msgid ""
"Here is invoice %(invoice)s for order %(order)s from %(seller)s. The PDF is "
"attached."
msgstr ""
"Adjuntamos la factura %(invoice)s del pedido %(order)s de %(seller)s en PDF."

msgid "Invoice %(invoice)s"
msgstr "Factura %(invoice)s"

msgid "It is paid in full."
msgstr "Está pagado en su totalidad."

msgid "The seats are yours once it is paid."
msgstr "Las plazas serán suyas una vez pagado."

msgid "View your order"
msgstr "Ver su pedido"

msgid "Sign in as one of the company's managers to open the order."
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión como uno de los responsables de la compañía para abrir el "
"pedido."

msgid ""
"You got this email because this address is the billing email for the order."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque esta dirección es el correo de "
"facturación del pedido."

msgid "Invoice %(invoice)s from %(seller)s"
msgstr "Factura %(invoice)s de %(seller)s"

msgid "Claim your free place at %(seller)s"
msgstr "Solicite su plaza gratuita en %(seller)s"

msgid "A free place at %(seller)s was requested for this email address."
msgstr ""
"Se ha solicitado una plaza gratuita en %(seller)s para esta dirección de "
"correo electrónico."

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then open the link "
"below to claim it:"
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión, o cree una cuenta, con esta dirección de correo electrónico "
"y, después, abra el enlace siguiente para solicitarla:"

msgid ""
"The link works until %(day)s. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"El enlace funciona hasta el %(day)s. Si no lo ha solicitado, ignore este "
"correo electrónico."

msgid "Claim your place"
msgstr "Solicitar su plaza"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("20 seats"); %(target)s a
#. course and %(batch)s its intake.
msgid "%(seats)s of %(target)s (%(batch)s)"
msgstr "%(seats)s de %(target)s (%(batch)s)"

msgid "Quote %(number)s"
msgstr "Presupuesto %(number)s"

msgid ""
"Here is quote %(number)s from %(seller)s for %(of)s. The PDF is attached."
msgstr ""
"Adjuntamos el presupuesto %(number)s de %(seller)s para %(of)s en PDF."

msgid ""
"To go ahead, order the seats from your catalog, or reply to this email."
msgstr ""
"Para continuar, pida las plazas desde su catálogo o responda a este correo "
"electrónico."

msgid "Quote"
msgstr "Presupuesto"

msgid "Seats"
msgstr "Plazas"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

msgid "Valid until"
msgstr "Válido hasta"

msgid "Order the seats"
msgstr "Pedir las plazas"

msgid ""
"This quote holds no seats. Prices and seats are confirmed when the order is "
"placed."
msgstr ""
"Este presupuesto no reserva plazas. Los precios y las plazas se confirman al"
" realizar el pedido."

msgid ""
"You got this email because %(organisation)s sent a quote to %(tenant)s."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque %(organisation)s envió un presupuesto "
"a %(tenant)s."

msgid "Quote %(number)s from %(seller)s"
msgstr "Presupuesto %(number)s de %(seller)s"

msgid "card"
msgstr "tarjeta"

msgid "bank transfer"
msgstr "transferencia bancaria"

msgid "account credit"
msgstr "crédito en la cuenta"

msgid "Your receipt for order %(number)s"
msgstr "Su recibo del pedido %(number)s"

#. Translators: %(total)s is money with its currency.
msgid ""
"Your payment of %(total)s for order %(number)s went through. You can start "
"learning now."
msgstr ""
"Se ha procesado su pago de %(total)s del pedido %(number)s. Ya puede empezar"
" a aprender."

msgid "Go to my learning"
msgstr "Ir a mi aprendizaje"

msgid "Your purchase"
msgstr "Su compra"

msgid "Subtotal"
msgstr "Subtotal"

msgid "Discount"
msgstr "Descuento"

msgid "Tax (included)"
msgstr "Impuestos (incluidos)"

msgid "Tax"
msgstr "Impuestos"

msgid "Total paid"
msgstr "Total pagado"

msgid "your purchase"
msgstr "su compra"

msgid ""
"It goes back the way you paid; your bank may take a few days to show it."
msgstr ""
"Se devuelve por el mismo medio con el que pagó; su banco puede tardar unos "
"días en reflejarlo."

msgid "We have paid it back to you directly."
msgstr "Se lo hemos devuelto directamente."

msgid "It is kept as credit on your account for your next purchase."
msgstr "Se guarda como crédito en su cuenta para su próxima compra."

msgid "Your refund for order %(number)s"
msgstr "Su reembolso del pedido %(number)s"

#. Translators: %(amount)s is money with its currency; %(how)s is a sentence
#. on how it is paid back.
msgid "We are refunding %(amount)s for order %(number)s. %(how)s"
msgstr "Le reembolsamos %(amount)s del pedido %(number)s. %(how)s"

msgid "your course"
msgstr "su curso"

#. Translators: %(learner)s is a person's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(learner)s bought %(title)s"
msgstr "%(learner)s ha comprado %(title)s"

msgid "%(learner)s bought %(title)s and can start now."
msgstr "%(learner)s ha comprado %(title)s y puede empezar ya."

msgid "%(learner)s enrolled in %(title)s"
msgstr "%(learner)s se ha inscrito en %(title)s"

msgid "%(learner)s enrolled themselves in %(title)s."
msgstr "%(learner)s se ha inscrito por su cuenta en %(title)s."

msgid "your subscription"
msgstr "su suscripción"

msgid ""
"We couldn't take your payment of %(amount)s for %(name)s. Update your "
"payment method by %(day)s to keep your access."
msgstr ""
"No hemos podido cobrar su pago de %(amount)s por %(name)s. Actualice su "
"método de pago antes del %(day)s para conservar el acceso."

msgid ""
"We couldn't take your payment of %(amount)s for %(name)s. Update your "
"payment method to keep your access."
msgstr ""
"No hemos podido cobrar su pago de %(amount)s por %(name)s. Actualice su "
"método de pago para conservar el acceso."

msgid "Your %(name)s payment couldn't be processed"
msgstr "No se ha podido procesar su pago de %(name)s"

msgid "We couldn't process your subscription payment."
msgstr "No hemos podido procesar el pago de su suscripción."

#. Translators: shown after a time written in UTC because the person chose no
#. time zone; {url} is the link
#. to their Settings page.
msgid "Shown in UTC. Set your time zone in Settings: {url}"
msgstr "Se muestra en UTC. Configure su zona horaria en Ajustes: {url}"

#. Translators: shown after a time written in UTC because the person chose no
#. time zone.
msgid "Shown in UTC. Set your time zone in Settings."
msgstr "Se muestra en UTC. Configure su zona horaria en Ajustes."

#. Translators: {time} is a time of day ("15:30"); {zone} a time zone's name
#. ("Asia/Kolkata").
msgid "{time} in {zone}"
msgstr "{time} en {zone}"

#. Translators: {name} is the course's title.
msgid "{name} finished building. Open it in Studio to review and publish it."
msgstr ""
"{name} ha terminado de crearse. Ábralo en Studio para revisarlo y "
"publicarlo."

msgid "{count} component could not be generated and need your attention."
msgid_plural ""
"{count} components could not be generated and need your attention."
msgstr[0] "No se ha podido generar {count} componente y requiere su atención."
msgstr[1] ""
"No se han podido generar {count} componentes y requieren su atención."

#. Translators: {name} is the course's title.
msgid "Your course {name} is ready"
msgstr "Su curso {name} está listo"

msgid "Open in Studio"
msgstr "Abrir en Studio"

msgid "You do not have access to this course."
msgstr "No tiene acceso a este curso."

#. Translators: {timestamp} is when the report arrived ("2026-11-19 09:30:00
#. UTC").
msgid "Crashlytics error report ({timestamp})"
msgstr "Informe de errores de Crashlytics ({timestamp})"

msgid "I completed the {course_title} course on {course_org_name}."
msgstr "He completado el curso {course_title} en {course_org_name}."

msgid ""
"I completed a course at {course_org_name}. Take a look at my certificate."
msgstr ""
"He completado un curso en {course_org_name}. Eche un vistazo a mi "
"certificado."

msgid "%(fullname)s, you earned a certificate!"
msgstr "%(fullname)s, ¡ha obtenido un certificado!"

msgid "Awarded to:"
msgstr "Otorgado a:"

msgid "Recipient Image"
msgstr "Imagen del destinatario"

msgid "Validity"
msgstr "Validez"

msgid "Does not expire"
msgstr "No caduca"

msgid "Share on"
msgstr "Compartir en"

msgid "Post on Facebook"
msgstr "Publicar en Facebook"

msgid "Tweet this Accomplishment"
msgstr "Tuitear este logro"

msgid "Add to LinkedIn Profile"
msgstr "Añadir al perfil de LinkedIn"

msgid "Download PDF"
msgstr "Descargar PDF"

msgid "This is to certify that"
msgstr "Por la presente se certifica que"

#. Translators: follows the learner's name, which the certificate shows on its
#. own line above; the sentence's subject is that name.
msgid "has successfully completed %(course_name)s offered by %(org_name)s"
msgstr "ha completado con éxito %(course_name)s ofrecido por %(org_name)s"

msgid "Date of Issue: %(date)s"
msgstr "Fecha de emisión: %(date)s"

msgid "Programme"
msgstr "Programa"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Verificado"

#. Translators: follows the learner's name, which the certificate shows on its
#. own line above; the sentence's subject is that name.
msgid ""
"has successfully completed and was awarded this certificate for the "
"programme above."
msgstr ""
"ha completado con éxito el programa anterior y ha obtenido este certificado."

msgid ""
"has successfully completed, received a passing grade, and was awarded this "
"certificate for the course above."
msgstr ""
"ha completado con éxito el curso anterior, ha obtenido una nota de aprobado "
"y ha recibido este certificado."

msgid "Issued on %(date)s"
msgstr "Emitido el %(date)s"

msgid "Valid until %(date)s"
msgstr "Válido hasta el %(date)s"

msgid "Sincerely,"
msgstr "Atentamente,"

msgid "Supported by the following organizations"
msgstr "Con el apoyo de las siguientes organizaciones"

msgid "Certificate of Attendance"
msgstr "Certificado de asistencia"

msgid "Noted by"
msgstr "Registrado por"

msgid "This certificate has been revoked"
msgstr "Este certificado se ha revocado"

msgid ""
"The certificate for %(program)s was revoked on %(date)s. It is no longer "
"valid."
msgstr "El certificado de %(program)s se revocó el %(date)s. Ya no es válido."

#. Translators: follows the learner's name, which the certificate shows on its
#. own line above; the sentence's subject is that name.
