"Tells the course team that a learner enrolled themselves in their course. "
"Enrollments performed by staff are not announced — whoever ran them already "
"knows."
msgstr ""
"Avisa al equipo del curso de que un estudiante se ha inscrito por su cuenta "
"en su curso. Las inscripciones realizadas por el personal no se anuncian: "
"quien las hizo ya lo sabe."

