msgid "Hi {{ full_name }},"
msgstr "Hola, {{ full_name }}:"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"You have a place in %(course)s at {{ org_name }}. Open it any time from My "
"learning."
msgstr ""
"Tiene una plaza en %(course)s en {{ org_name }}. Ábralo cuando quiera desde "
"Mi aprendizaje."

msgid "You got this email because you were enrolled in {{ course_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque se le inscribió en {{ course_name }}."

msgid "Your enrollment in {{ course_name }} changed"
msgstr "Ha cambiado su inscripción en {{ course_name }}"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Your access to %(course)s at {{ org_name }} changed. Open the course to see "
"what's new; you carry on from where you left off."
msgstr ""
"Su acceso a %(course)s en {{ org_name }} ha cambiado. Abra el curso para ver"
" las novedades; continuará donde lo dejó."

msgid ""
"You got this email because your enrollment in {{ course_name }} changed."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque ha cambiado su inscripción en {{ "
"course_name }}."

msgid "You earned your {{ course_name }} certificate"
msgstr "Ha obtenido su certificado de {{ course_name }}"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You passed %(course)s at {{ org_name }} and earned its "
"certificate. You can view it, download it and share it."
msgstr ""
"¡Enhorabuena! Ha aprobado %(course)s en {{ org_name }} y ha obtenido su "
"certificado. Puede verlo, descargarlo y compartirlo."

msgid "You got this email because you completed {{ course_name }}."
msgstr "Recibe este correo electrónico porque completó {{ course_name }}."

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold; {{ expired_on }} is a
#. date.
msgid ""
"Your certificate for %(course)s at {{ org_name }} expired on {{ expired_on "
"}}."
msgstr ""
"Su certificado de %(course)s en {{ org_name }} caducó el {{ expired_on }}."

msgid ""
"Your graded attempts and scores for the course were reset, so you can start "
"fresh. Pass the assessments again and a new certificate is issued "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Se han restablecido sus intentos calificados y sus puntuaciones del curso "
"para que pueda empezar de cero. Vuelva a aprobar las evaluaciones y se "
"emitirá automáticamente un nuevo certificado."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you held a certificate for {{ course_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque tenía un certificado de {{ course_name"
" }}."

msgid "You're invited to join {{ display_name }}"
msgstr "Le invitan a unirse a {{ display_name }}"

#. Translators: %(name)s is the organisation's or course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"You're invited to join %(name)s on {{ platform_name }}. Accept the "
"invitation to get started."
msgstr ""
"Le invitan a unirse a %(name)s en {{ platform_name }}. Acepte la invitación "
"para empezar."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the invited email address in bold.
msgid ""
"Sign in or register with %(address)s: the invitation is for this address."
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión o regístrese con %(address)s: la invitación es para esta "
"dirección."

msgid ""
"This link works until {{ expires_on }}. If a new invitation is sent, this "
"one stops working."
msgstr ""
"Este enlace funciona hasta el {{ expires_on }}. Si se envía una nueva "
"invitación, este dejará de funcionar."

msgid ""
"You got this email because someone at {{ org_name }} invited {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico porque alguien de {{ org_name }} invitó a {{ "
"email_address }}."

#. Translators: %(role)s is the role's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ inviter_name }} gave you the %(role)s role at {{ org_name }}. Sign in to "
"get started."
msgstr ""
"{{ inviter_name }} le ha asignado el rol %(role)s en {{ org_name }}. Inicie "
"sesión para empezar."

