msgstr "su programa"

msgid "Your enrollment in %(title)s was updated"
msgstr "Se ha actualizado su inscripción en %(title)s"

msgid "You're enrolled in %(title)s"
msgstr "Se ha inscrito en %(title)s"

msgid "Your access to %(title)s changed. Open the course to see what's new."
msgstr ""
"Su acceso a %(title)s ha cambiado. Abra el curso para ver las novedades."

msgid "You have a place in %(title)s. Open it from My learning."
msgstr "Tiene una plaza en %(title)s. Ábralo desde Mi aprendizaje."

msgid "Go to my program"
msgstr "Ir a mi programa"

msgid "You've earned your %(title)s certificate"
msgstr "Ha obtenido su certificado de %(title)s"

msgid "Congratulations! You passed %(title)s and earned its certificate."
msgstr "¡Enhorabuena! Ha aprobado %(title)s y ha obtenido su certificado."

msgid "You got this email because of your notification settings."
msgstr ""
"Recibe este correo electrónico por su configuración de notificaciones."

msgid "A learner"
msgstr "Un estudiante"

msgid "%(who)s completed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s ha completado %(title)s con una plaza de %(tenant)s."

msgid "%(who)s passed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s ha aprobado %(title)s con una plaza de %(tenant)s."

#. Translators: %(who)s is a learner's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(who)s finished %(title)s"
msgstr "%(who)s ha terminado %(title)s"

msgid "%(email)s hasn't accepted your invitation"
msgstr "%(email)s no ha aceptado su invitación"

#. Translators: %(day)s is the date the invitation was sent.
msgid ""
"You invited %(email)s to learn with %(tenant)s on %(day)s, and they haven't "
"accepted yet. You can send the invitation again from People."
msgstr ""
"Invitó a %(email)s a aprender con %(tenant)s el %(day)s y aún no ha "
"aceptado. Puede volver a enviar la invitación desde Personas."

msgid "a course"
msgstr "un curso"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("3 seats"); %(where)s what
#. they are for.
msgid "%(seats)s in %(where)s not given out yet"
msgstr "%(seats)s en %(where)s aún sin asignar"

msgid ""
"%(tenant)s still has %(seats)s to give out in %(where)s. Enrollment closes "
"on %(day)s; seats not given by then can't be used."
msgstr ""
"%(tenant)s aún tiene %(seats)s por asignar en %(where)s. La inscripción se "
"cierra el %(day)s; las plazas no asignadas para entonces no se podrán usar."

msgid "Order %(number)s is paid"
msgstr "El pedido %(number)s está pagado"

#. Translators: %(total)s is money with its currency; %(tenant)s a company.
msgid ""
"We received %(total)s for %(tenant)s's order %(number)s. Its seats are ready"
" to give out."
msgstr ""
"Hemos recibido %(total)s por el pedido %(number)s de %(tenant)s. Sus plazas "
"están listas para asignar."

msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Política de privacidad"

msgid "Terms of use"
msgstr "Condiciones de uso"

msgid "%(tenant)s is ready"
msgstr "%(tenant)s está lista"

#. Translators: %(limit)s is a number of people.
msgid ""
"Your account is active. You can have up to %(limit)s people learning at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"Su cuenta está activa. Puede tener hasta %(limit)s personas aprendiendo a la"
" vez."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name; %(limit)s is a number of
#. people.
msgid ""
"%(tenant)s's contract was renewed with a learner limit of %(limit)s. Choose "
"who keeps access."
msgstr ""
"El contrato de %(tenant)s se ha renovado con un límite de %(limit)s "
"estudiantes. Elija quién conserva el acceso."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is on hold for payment"
msgstr "%(tenant)s está en espera de pago"

msgid ""
"Learning your company pays for is paused until this is cleared. Progress and"
" certificates are kept."
msgstr ""
"El aprendizaje que paga su compañía está en pausa hasta que esto se "
"resuelva. El progreso y los certificados se conservan."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is no longer on hold"
msgstr "%(tenant)s ya no está en espera"

msgid ""
"The payment hold has ended. Your people can carry on with their learning."
msgstr ""
"La espera de pago ha finalizado. Su equipo puede continuar con su "
"aprendizaje."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is blocked"
msgstr "%(tenant)s está bloqueada"

msgid ""
"Nobody can use your company's account or the learning it pays for until it "
"is unblocked."
msgstr ""
"Nadie puede usar la cuenta de su compañía ni el aprendizaje que paga hasta "
"que se desbloquee."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is unblocked"
msgstr "%(tenant)s está desbloqueada"

msgid "You and your people can sign in and carry on."
msgstr "Usted y su equipo pueden iniciar sesión y continuar."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s asks to renew"
msgstr "%(tenant)s solicita la renovación"

#. Translators: %(who)s is a person's name, %(tenant)s the company they manage
#. and %(note)s their own
#. message.
msgid ""
"%(who)s, who manages %(tenant)s, asked to renew the company's contract. "
"“%(note)s”"
msgstr ""
"%(who)s, responsable de %(tenant)s, ha solicitado renovar el contrato de la "
"compañía. «%(note)s»"

#. Translators: %(who)s is a person's name; %(tenant)s is the company they
#. manage.
msgid ""
"%(who)s, who manages %(tenant)s, asked to renew the company's contract."
msgstr ""
"%(who)s, responsable de %(tenant)s, ha solicitado renovar el contrato de la "
"compañía."

#. Translators: %(seats)s lists the seats, such as "20 seats in Fire safety
#. and 5 seats in First aid".
msgid "Your %(seats)s is ready to give out."
msgid_plural "Your %(seats)s are ready to give out."
msgstr[0] "Su %(seats)s está lista para asignar."
msgstr[1] "Sus %(seats)s están listas para asignar."

msgid "An invoice is overdue."
msgstr "Hay una factura vencida."

msgid "The overdue invoice is settled."
msgstr "La factura vencida está liquidada."

msgid "The reason given:"
msgstr "El motivo indicado:"

msgid "Grades"
msgstr "Notas"

msgid "Enrollments"
msgstr "Inscripciones"

msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "Certificados"

msgid "Session attendance"
msgstr "Asistencia a la sesión"

msgid "Learner progress"
msgstr "Progreso del estudiante"

msgid "Every answer"
msgstr "Cada respuesta"

msgid "Submissions"
msgstr "Entregas"

msgid "Anonymous IDs"
msgstr "ID anónimos"

msgid "Video views"
msgstr "Visualizaciones de vídeo"

msgid "Assessment scores"
msgstr "Puntuaciones de la evaluación"

msgid "Invited, not enrolled"
msgstr "Invitado, sin inscribir"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "Your {report} report is ready"
msgstr "Su informe {report} está listo"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "The {report} report for this course is ready to download."
msgstr "El informe {report} de este curso está listo para descargar."

msgid "Download the report"
msgstr "Descargar el informe"

msgid "Your data is ready to download"
msgstr "Sus datos están listos para descargar"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Sus datos están listos: un archivo zip con todo lo que Blend-ed conserva. El"
" enlace funciona durante {days} días y solo para usted."

#. Translators: the title when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account.
msgid "this person's data is ready to download"
msgstr "Los datos de esta persona están listos para descargar"

#. Translators: the message when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account; {days} is
#. how many days the link works.
msgid ""
"this person's data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The "
"link works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Los datos de esta persona están listos: un archivo zip con todo lo que "
"Blend-ed conserva. El enlace funciona durante {days} días y solo para usted."

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported.
msgid "{name}'s data is ready to download"
msgstr "Los datos de {name} están listos para descargar"

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported; {days} how many
#. days the link works.
msgid ""
"{name}'s data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Los datos de {name} están listos: un archivo zip con todo lo que Blend-ed "
"conserva. El enlace funciona durante {days} días y solo para usted."

msgid "Download the file"
msgstr "Descargar el archivo"

msgid "Your full export is ready to download"
msgstr "Su exportación completa está lista para descargar"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your full export is ready: one zip file of your platform's records. The link"
" works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Su exportación completa está lista: un archivo zip con los registros de su "
"plataforma. El enlace funciona durante {days} días y solo para usted."

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name; {start} and {end} are dates
#. (YYYY-MM-DD),
#. {end} followed by the period's time zone ("2026-11-23 UTC").
msgid "The {report} report for {start} to {end} is ready to download."
msgstr "El informe {report} del {start} al {end} está listo para descargar."

#. Translators: {month} is the month just ended with its time zone ("October
#. 2026 UTC"); the others are
#. counts.
msgid ""
"{month}. Seats in use: {assigned} of {funded}. New seats: {new_seats}. "
"Results recorded: {results}. Certificates earned: {certificates}."
msgstr ""
"{month}. Plazas en uso: {assigned} de {funded}. Plazas nuevas: {new_seats}. "
"Resultados registrados: {results}. Certificados obtenidos: {certificates}."

#. Translators: {end} is the week's last day, a Sunday, with its time zone
#. ("22 November 2026 UTC"); the others
#. are counts.
msgid ""
"Week to {end}. Seats in use: {assigned} of {funded}. New seats: {new_seats}."
" Results recorded: {results}. Certificates earned: {certificates}."
msgstr ""
"Semana hasta el {end}. Plazas en uso: {assigned} de {funded}. Plazas nuevas:"
" {new_seats}. Resultados registrados: {results}. Certificados obtenidos: "
"{certificates}."

#. Translators: {tenant} is the company's name.
msgid "{tenant}: your month in learning"
msgstr "{tenant}: su mes de aprendizaje"

#. Translators: {tenant} is the company's name.
msgid "{tenant}: your week in learning"
msgstr "{tenant}: su semana de aprendizaje"

#. Translators: {name} is the instructor's name; {title} is the session's
#. name.
msgid "{name} is away for {title}"
msgstr "{name} está ausente para {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name, {when} the date's start and
#. {name} the instructor's name.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in {name}'s time off. They are still its instructor "
"until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} del {when} coincide con el tiempo libre de {name}. Sigue siendo su "
"instructor hasta que usted lo cambie."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; the instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid "An instructor is away for {title}"
msgstr "Un instructor está ausente para {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name and {when} the date's start; the
#. instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in the instructor's time off. They are still its "
"instructor until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} del {when} coincide con el tiempo libre del instructor. Sigue siendo"
" su instructor hasta que usted lo cambie."

msgid "{name}, you earned a Session certificate!"
msgstr "{name}, ¡ha obtenido un certificado de sesión!"

#. Translators: {part} is the date's number within the session; {title} is the
#. session's name.
msgid "Part {part} of {title}"
msgstr "Parte {part} de {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who moved the date; {title} the date's name; {when}
#. the new date and time, {was}
#. the old one.
msgid "{by} moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "{by} ha cambiado {title} a {when} (antes: {was})."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title} was moved to …"). {when} is the new date and
#. time, {was} the old one.
msgid "moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "ha cambiado {title} a {when} (antes: {was})."

msgid "{title} moved"
msgstr "{title} cambiada"

#. Translators: {by} is who cancelled the date; {title} the date's name; {was}
#. the date and time it had.
msgid "{by} cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "{by} ha cancelado {title}, {was}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title}, {was}, was cancelled."). {was} is the date and
#. time it had.
msgid "cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "ha cancelado {title}, {was}."

msgid "{title} cancelled"
msgstr "{title} cancelada"

#. Translators: {by} is who added the instructor; {title} the date's name;
#. {when} its date and time.
msgid "{by} added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "{by} le ha añadido a {title}, {when}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("You were added to {title}, {when}."). {when} is the
#. date and time.
msgid "added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "le ha añadido a {title}, {when}."

msgid "You're teaching {title}"
msgstr "Imparte {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who changed the date's instructors; {title} the date's
#. name; {was} its date and time.
msgid "{by} changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr ""
"{by} ha cambiado sus instructores; {title} del {was} ya no le corresponde."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a complete
#. sentence ("Its instructors changed; …"). {was} is the date and time.
msgid "changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr "ha cambiado sus instructores; {title} del {was} ya no le corresponde."

msgid "You're no longer teaching {title}"
msgstr "Ya no imparte {title}"

msgid "Confirm attendance for {title}"
msgstr "Confirmar la asistencia a {title}"

msgid "{title} has ended. Confirm who attended."
msgstr "{title} ha terminado. Confirme quién asistió."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {minutes} how many minutes
#. until it starts. English keeps
#. "minutes" even for 1.
msgid "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} empieza en {minutes} minutos"
msgstr[1] "{title} empieza en {minutes} minutos"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} its start date and time.
msgid "{title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "{title} empieza el {when}."

msgid "Tomorrow: {count} session"
msgid_plural "Tomorrow: {count} sessions"
msgstr[0] "Mañana: {count} sesión"
msgstr[1] "Mañana: {count} sesiones"

msgid "{count} new submission to review"
msgid_plural "{count} new submissions to review"
msgstr[0] "{count} entrega nueva para revisar"
msgstr[1] "{count} entregas nuevas para revisar"

#. Translators: {batch} is the batch's name; {count} how many submissions wait
#. for a grade.
msgid "{batch}: {count} submission waiting for a grade."
msgid_plural "{batch}: {count} submissions waiting for a grade."
msgstr[0] "{batch}: {count} entrega pendiente de calificar."
msgstr[1] "{batch}: {count} entregas pendientes de calificar."

msgid "Weekly review due for {batches}"
msgstr "Revisión semanal pendiente de {batches}"

msgid "below the passing score"
msgstr "por debajo de la nota de aprobado"

msgid "not active for 14 days"
msgstr "sin actividad durante 14 días"

msgid "not active for 7 days"
msgstr "sin actividad durante 7 días"

msgid "behind on progress"
msgstr "con retraso en el progreso"

msgid "has not started"
msgstr "no ha empezado"

msgid "failed an assessment"
msgstr "suspendió una evaluación"

msgid "behind schedule"
msgstr "con retraso"

msgid "{name} needs help"
msgstr "{name} necesita ayuda"

#. Translators: {name} is the learner's name, {batch} the batch's and {why}
#. the reasons,
#. comma-separated.
msgid "{name} in {batch}: {why}."
msgstr "{name} en {batch}: {why}."

msgid "{title}: your date has moved"
msgstr "{title}: su fecha ha cambiado"

msgid "Your date of {title} now starts at {when}."
msgstr "Su fecha de {title} ahora empieza el {when}."

msgid "{title}: your date is cancelled"
msgstr "{title}: su fecha se ha cancelado"

msgid ""
"The date of {title} you had a place on is cancelled. You can book another "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Se ha cancelado la fecha de {title} en la que tenía plaza. Puede reservar "
"otra fecha."

msgid "{title}: you have a place"
msgstr "{title}: tiene una plaza"

msgid "A place freed on {title} and you are booked for {when}."
msgstr "Se ha liberado una plaza en {title} y tiene reserva para {when}."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many hours until it
#. starts.
msgid "{title} starts in {count} hour"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} hours"
msgstr[0] "{title} empieza en {count} hora"
msgstr[1] "{title} empieza en {count} horas"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in 1 hour"
msgstr "{title} empieza en 1 hora"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in a few minutes"
msgstr "{title} empieza en unos minutos"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many minutes until
#. it starts (5 or more).
msgid "{title} starts in {count} minute"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} empieza en {count} minuto"
msgstr[1] "{title} empieza en {count} minutos"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} is its start date and
#. time.
msgid "Your booked date of {title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "Su fecha reservada de {title} empieza el {when}."

#. Translators: {name} is who raised it, {type} the ticket's type code (issue,
#. bug, feature, other) and {title}
#. its title.
msgid "{name} raised a new {type} ticket: {title}"
msgstr "{name} ha abierto un nuevo ticket de tipo {type}: {title}"

msgid "New support ticket"
msgstr "Nuevo ticket de soporte"

msgid "Your support update"
msgstr "Novedades de su solicitud de soporte"

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been closed."
msgstr "Su ticket {title} se ha cerrado."

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been reopened."
msgstr "Su ticket {title} se ha reabierto."

msgid "Ticket assigned to you"
msgstr "Ticket asignado a usted"

msgid "You have been assigned the ticket {title}."
msgstr "Se le ha asignado el ticket {title}."

#. Translators: {name} is who commented, {title} the ticket's title and
#. {comment} their words.
msgid "{name} commented on your ticket {title}: {comment}"
msgstr "{name} ha comentado en su ticket {title}: {comment}"

msgid "New comment on your ticket"
msgstr "Nuevo comentario en su ticket"
